<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/technology-integration> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Addresses the organizational and instructional process of embedding technology in educational practice." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/technology-integration/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/technology-integration> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/fieldCollection> <https://id.i2idl.org/collections/field/education> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/technology-integration/versions/1> .
